# Code style

## Imports

- ESM only. Relative imports use **`.js` suffix** (`from '../errors.js'`).
- Named exports preferred.

## Validation

- Schemas only in **`src/tools/schemas.ts`**. Handlers use **`safeTool`** + `safeParse`.
- Update **`test/schemas.test.ts`** (or related) when bounds change.

## MCP stdio

- **`installStdioGuard()`** at startup. No `console.log` on stdout path.
- Operator logs: **`console.error`** with `[searchconsole-mcp]` prefix.
- Tool text: **`sanitizeToolError`**; success via **`formatToolResult`** (`GSC_OUTPUT_FORMAT`).

## Tests

- **`node:test`** + **`node:assert/strict`**. Mock GSC via **`setGscClientForTests`**.

## Red flags

| Stop | Why |
|------|-----|
| `./foo` without `.js` | ESM break |
| Zod inline in `gsc*.ts` | Drift from MCP args |
| `console.log` in server/tools | Breaks JSON-RPC |
| Live GSC in `npm test` | CI flake |
